<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>در حال به‌روزرسانی</title>
  <style>
    body { margin:0; background:#0a0a1a; color:#c9e9ff; font-family: IRANSans, Vazirmatn, sans-serif; height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
    .box { text-align:center; border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,0.4); border-radius:12px; padding:28px 34px; background:rgba(17,24,39,0.5); box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0,255,255,0.08), inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,255,255,0.05); }
    h1 { margin:0 0 10px; font-size:22px; color:#7ce3ff; }
    p { margin:0; opacity:.8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <h1>در حال به‌روزرسانی</h1>
    <p>این بخش به‌زودی فعال می‌شود...</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
